                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "[h1]\nAsteroids like game with competitive gameplay. Can be played with bots or with your grandpa on rage mode. Simple but definitely not bad. Music is solid. Grab power ups to smash your opponents and shield to protect from incoming bullets. Power ups include laser, minigun, rockets, bombs, nuclear warhead? One of those games that are cheap but good to play. Support all resolutions and controller without hassle.\n[/h1]",
